  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 518.16 Documents.\n\n(a) Each municipal agent shall forward the following to the department on a daily basis:\n\n(1) The DMV copy of each registration certificate processed by the municipal agent; and\n\n(2) A written summary which shall include:\n\na. The total amount of fees being forwarded;\n\nb. The total number of registrations processed to obtain the fees; and\n\nc. The municipal agent's signature, certifying the accuracy of the information contained in the summary.\n\n(b) In addition to the documents required in (a) above, each municipal agent shall forward all fees owed to the department in accordance with the requirements set forth in Saf-C 518.21(b).\n\n(c) Each municipal agent shall, on a daily basis, print and save the end of day report.\n\nSource. #7972, eff 10-17-03 (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Saf-C 500); amd by #8999, eff 9-29-07; amd by #9995, INTERIM, eff 9-17-11, EXPIRED: 3-15-12 (paragraph (b))\n\nNew. #10135, eff 5-23-12; ss by #13521, eff 1-13-23 (formerly Saf-C 519.16)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c500.html"
